              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 6:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wathi kuAhimeleki umpristi: Inkosi ingiphathise udaba, yathi kimi: Ungatsheli muntu ngaloludaba engikuthuma lona, lengikuphathise lona. Lapho ngivalelisa insizwa zami, ngizitshelile ukuthi zizahlangana lami endaweni ethile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manjeke kuyini olakho wena? Nginika izinkwa ezinhlanu loba kuyini nje okukhona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umpristi wamphendula uDavida wathi: Kangilaso isinkwa esejwayelekileyo nje, isinkwa esahlukaniselwe iNkosi; kodwa insizwa zizigcinile esifazaneni na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasemphendula umpristi esithi: Impela abesifazana bavinjelwe kithi njengokwejwayelekileyo lapho ngiphuma impi. Imizimba yezinsizwa ihlala ihlambulukile, lanxa ngihamba uhambo nje olwejwayelekileyo; pho, lamhla ihlambuluke okunganani na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho umpristi wasemnika isinkwa esahlukaniselwe iNkosi; ngoba kwakungekho sinkwa lapho, kuphela isinkwa esahlukaniselwe uNkulunkulu, ebesisuswe phambi kweNkosi ukuba kubekwe esisatshisayo mhla sisuswayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.24.5+LEV.24.6+LEV.24.7+LEV.24.8+LEV.24.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 24:5–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunye wezinceku zikaSawuli wayelapho mhlalokho, ebambekile phambi kweNkosi, ibizo lakhe linguDowegi waseEdoma, induna yabelusi bakaSawuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wathi kuAhimeleki: Kawulamkhonto loba umhedla lapha na? Ngoba kangizanga lomhedla wami lezikhali zami, ngoba ngingxamele indaba yenkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umpristi wathi: Umhedla kaGoliyathi umFilistiya, owambulala esigodini saseEla, ukhona lapho ngemva kwengubo yamahlombe, ugoqelwe ngelembu; uba uthanda ukuwuthatha, uthathe, ngoba kawukho omunye lapha ngaphandle kwawo. UDavida wathi: Kawukho ofana lalowo; nginika wona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 17:51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
